<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25233" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διᾰμείβω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exchange,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι πρός τι</span> one thing <i>with</i>
			another, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				289e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς οἰκίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.6.1
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισὶ τῆς ἀρετῆς τὸν πλοῦτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
					15.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι ἀντί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					915e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἱμάτια πρός τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cim.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαμεῖψαι Ἀσίαν Εὐρώπης</span>
			<i>change</i> Asia <i>for</i> Europe, i.e. <i>pass into</i>
			Asia, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				397
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. μεταβολήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					392
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὴν φύσιν πρός τι</span> ib.
				<i><span class="en">
				396
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. ὁδόν</span>
			<i>finish</i> a journey, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				334
			</span></i>(lyr.):—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολιχῆς τέρμα κελεύθου διαμειψάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					287
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); but in 
				Med.
			 also, <i>pass through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ φῦλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					543
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντου πεδίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					150
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>cross, traverse,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Goth.</u>
					3.40
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>change,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Parm.
					8.41
				</span></i>
			 (tm.):—abs. in 
				Med.
			, <i>alter,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.108
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγορὰς διαποντίους δ.</span>
			<i>trade in</i> foreign markets, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				5.66
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>requite,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				56.6
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
